  << /ActualText (Revenue \046 Key Accounts\240\nOwn the annual and quarterly sales plan and deliver against revenue targets\056\240\nPersonally manage strategic OEM and Tier\0551 accounts\054 from technical discussion and sampling through pilots\054 commercial negotiation\054 and purchase orders\056\240\nLead pricing\054 commercial proposals\054 and contract negotiations in coordination with the founders\056\240\nBuild long\055term customer relationships that lead to repeat and scaled supply business\056\240\n\nBuilding New Verticals \0500 to 1\051\240\nIdentify and evaluate new application segments and markets for Naxatra\047s motors and controllers\056\240\nBuild new verticals from zero\072 market assessment\054 go\055to\055market strategy\054 target account list\054 first customer wins\054 and scale\055up plan\056\240\nWork with product and engineering teams to translate market needs into product and pricing decisions\056\240)
