1365 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We are looking for a Senior Sales Manager to lead Naxatra\047s sales function and drive revenue growth across our EV and industrial motor portfolio\056 The role owns the sales team\054 the pipeline\054 and sales reporting to the founders\054 and is accountable for converting OEM and Tier\0551 opportunities into long\055term supply business\056\240\nA core part of this role is building new business verticals from zero\072 identifying an untapped segment\054 shaping the go\055to\055market plan\054 landing the first customers\054 and scaling it into a repeatable revenue stream\056 We are looking for a leader who has done this before in automotive\056\240\nThis is an onsite position requiring presence at our Gurugram\054 Haryana office from Monday to Saturday\054 with frequent travel to customer sites across India\056\240)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 1366 0 R
     /Pg 1325 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
